  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Just tried out the new UI 2.0 Update and while I like virtually all of the changes and updates there was one regression which I'm not liking: When browsing worlds in the new UI, such as going down the list of New or Recently Updated worlds, if you then select a world to visit, go to that world, then re-open the world list, your browsing progress isn't remembered and you end up back at the top. Not too big a deal if you were only a few worlds down the list, kind of a big deal if you're 100+ worlds down the list and still want to check out more, though admittedly, it's more of an inconvenience having to scroll back down now than an actual bug but I would appreciate seeing this addressed in the future. :B",
